c31b1d0277633dff6206e611fd64b6e5bf61ad3476fe2632650285077f87a9e60e4044bc99066cb86f18ee87a2b4eecd04c8e053b877774a31794017a487e0e5  0002-busyindicator-fade-numberanimation.patch
"
